# License Selection Pending

An open-source license has not yet been selected for DETOX Code.

The project maintainers and community will decide on an appropriate open-source license (such as MIT, Apache 2.0, or AGPLv3) during the initial repository setup phase.

Until an official LICENSE file is committed, all rights remain reserved by the DETOX community maintainers. For questions or suggestions regarding licensing, please open an issue or reach out to project maintainers.
